    </node>
    <node id="MATRIX">
      <data key="d0">EVENT</data>
      <data key="d1">Matrix refers to the problem's primary subject, which involves a matrix of characters that needs to be transformed into a "good matrix" by exchanging adjacent characters. The event is characterized by the transformation process itself and the conditions that define a "good matrix."</data>
