    <edge source="&quot;CONTROL_STRUCTURE&quot;" target="&quot;ENUMERATION_AND_SORTING&quot;">
      <data key="d3">80.0</data>
      <data key="d4">"Control structures are often used to implement enumeration and sorting algorithms."&lt;SEP&gt;"Control structures, particularly sorting, are used to evaluate different mid-point values and select the one that minimizes operations."&lt;SEP&gt;"The control structure implements the enumeration process by sliding through the array and checking each window."&lt;SEP&gt;"There is a weak relationship as control structures are used to handle enumeration (considering different cases based on the value of x) and sorting is not involved in this context."&lt;SEP&gt;"The sorting is correctly implemented using control structures like for loops."&lt;SEP&gt;"The control structure is used to navigate through the enumeration and sorting process to find the target elements."&lt;SEP&gt;"The program uses control structures to attempt enumeration and sorting operations, but the error indicates this implementation may be flawed."&lt;SEP&gt;"The student's control structures appear to be insufficient for properly implementing the necessary enumeration and sorting operations required by the matrix transformation problem."&lt;SEP&gt;"The control structures in the student's program would support implementing enumeration and sorting algorithms if correctly applied."&lt;SEP&gt;"The control structures in the student's code such as if and for loops are integral to executing the Enumeration and Sorting logic. However, inappropriate use or ordering of these controls leads to errors, suggesting a misunderstanding of how these structures interact in the given context."&lt;SEP&gt;"The student correctly sorts subarrays using enumeration and sorting, leveraging control structures like loops to process queries."&lt;SEP&gt;"While the student implemented control structures correctly, there appears to be an issue with how sorting and enumeration are being handled, as reflected in the partial correctness score."</data>
      <data key="d5">chunk-d0121bcb7315f1b6c1b1e1e1aa31da20&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-2c18434ce64bd6a6f9f22c0ce89bd936&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-5ab4f5bf86ada7b486cce8436e89108f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-1fa396a1e574085f91576e710eaa87a5&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-b18e96e1c770e179fa3bc6a50d441a37&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-8f1384c8bae99cbc7f091721e9d96831&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-ea9ae7a51aebab6821f40062b4d3226b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-ff946a543c1cf79500f6aaeba33d06ff&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-246822371b4a88626131f0e16a7011d4&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c84eba6b6eff8493a43c7fd384677acc&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-19b2c89ce18073790268729bdeee92b8&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f51fa172e57c73db466ea836759cfee6</data>
