    <edge source="&quot;ENUMERATION_AND_SORTING&quot;" target="&quot;GREEDY&quot;">
      <data key="d3">38.0</data>
      <data key="d4">"If a greedy approach was attempted, it would likely involve sorting operations, and the student's error might indicate a failure to properly implement this relationship."&lt;SEP&gt;"The enumeration of mid-point values is used in a greedy manner to select the value minimizing operations after sorting."&lt;SEP&gt;"The enumeration process follows a greedy approach as it checks each window without need for revisiting or backtracking."&lt;SEP&gt;"The sorting and enumeration techniques are used to implement the greedy approach of selecting optimal values, but the error suggests that while the concepts are understood, their integration in this specific problem scenario has a flaw."&lt;SEP&gt;"The student attempts to enumerate and sort potential target elements as part of a greedy selection process."&lt;SEP&gt;"The student uses enumeration and sorting concepts to prepare data for the greedy approach, showing understanding of both concepts despite potential issues with the greedy implementation."</data>
      <data key="d5">chunk-76ad26408e208da706658bcd14bf1984&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-b18e96e1c770e179fa3bc6a50d441a37&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-8f1384c8bae99cbc7f091721e9d96831&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c84eba6b6eff8493a43c7fd384677acc&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-e254b213aa6b76246da6fea546fc6c73&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f51fa172e57c73db466ea836759cfee6</data>
