    <edge source="&quot;ENUMERATION_AND_SORTING&quot;" target="&quot;SIMULATION&quot;">
      <data key="d3">108.0</data>
      <data key="d4">"Both concepts are used together in the student's approach to systematically check and apply operations to transform the matrix into the desired form."&lt;SEP&gt;"Enumeration techniques are key in simulating the construction of determinants that meet specific conditions."&lt;SEP&gt;"The program attempts to simulate different solutions through enumeration of possible values. The approach involves trying integer values that satisfy the determinant equation."&lt;SEP&gt;"The program attempts to simulate different solutions through enumeration of possible values."&lt;SEP&gt;"The sorting of mid-point values is part of the simulation process to test different scenarios."&lt;SEP&gt;The enumeration of matrix elements during simulation involves identifying elements that need to be moved and their target positions.&lt;SEP&gt;"The student's approach likely involves some form of enumeration or sorting that didn't properly simulate the required matrix transformations."&lt;SEP&gt;"The act of enumerating and sorting positions or values in the matrix is directly related to the simulation of the swapping process, as they are key steps in transforming the matrix."&lt;SEP&gt;"The enumeration of matrix elements (sorting-like process) is directly used to guide the simulation of moves."&lt;SEP&gt;"Proper implementation of enumeration and sorting is essential for an accurate simulation of the matrix transformation process, which the student failed to achieve correctly."&lt;SEP&gt;"Enumeration_and_Sorting is used within the simulation process to systematically transform the matrix into the desired state."&lt;SEP&gt;"To simulate the matrix transformations, both enumeration of possible states and sorting of elements might be necessary steps."&lt;SEP&gt;"The sorting of subarrays is a key part of simulating the query responses, showing an interplay between enumeration/sorting and simulation."&lt;SEP&gt;"The student's understanding seems lacking in how to properly simulate the sorting of a subarray and track the movement of elements, leading to the error and partial score."</data>
      <data key="d5">chunk-4e4b814718769c7c5ff34fd8d9992e16&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-26ade306a8bffa48f05220f8acafd11e&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-4524936a6b8c2ae52a229c861568c00f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-2c18434ce64bd6a6f9f22c0ce89bd936&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-1fa396a1e574085f91576e710eaa87a5&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-cf3655e2f9ff0ad97a40cbb5e827990f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-ba8082d2aafc7f8fc80c51b5821c2ae7&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-ff946a543c1cf79500f6aaeba33d06ff&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-246822371b4a88626131f0e16a7011d4&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c84eba6b6eff8493a43c7fd384677acc&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a78168579a4a01a20c4871cdaa1bbe59&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f51fa172e57c73db466ea836759cfee6&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-98f7559a33bedc5f901d766c18542da6</data>
