      <data key="d6">1</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="&quot;IF (STD::ABS(E) &lt; 1)&quot;" target="&quot;INT E = (X + 1) / 3&quot;">
      <data key="d3">9.0</data>
      <data key="d4">"The condition 'if (std::abs(e) &lt; 1)' relies on the value calculated in 'int e = (x + 1) / 3'."</data>
      <data key="d5">chunk-2d49adf7c339e42e84130e12d95429c1</data>
      <data key="d6">1</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="&quot;IF (STD::ABS(E) &lt; 1)&quot;" target="&quot;IF (X % 3 == 0)&quot;">
      <data key="d3">9.0</data>
      <data key="d4">"The 'if (x % 3 == 0)' condition is evaluated only if the condition 'if (std::abs(e) &lt; 1)' is true."</data>
      <data key="d5">chunk-2d49adf7c339e42e84130e12d95429c1</data>
      <data key="d6">1</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="&quot;IF (X % 3 == 0)&quot;" target="&quot;E = (X &gt; 0) ? (X / 3 + 1) : (X / 3 - 1)&quot;">
      <data key="d3">9.0</data>
      <data key="d4">"The assignment 'e = (x &gt; 0) ? (x / 3 + 1) : (x / 3 - 1)' is the action taken within the 'if (x % 3 == 0)' block."</data>
      <data key="d5">chunk-2d49adf7c339e42e84130e12d95429c1</data>
      <data key="d6">1</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="&quot;IF (X % 3 == 0)&quot;" target="&quot;ELSE&quot;">
      <data key="d3">9.0</data>
      <data key="d4">"The 'else' block is associated with the condition 'if (x % 3 == 0)', handling the case where x is not divisible by 3."</data>
      <data key="d5">chunk-2d49adf7c339e42e84130e12d95429c1</data>
      <data key="d6">1</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="&quot;ELSE&quot;" target="&quot;E = (X &gt; 0) ? (X / 3 + (X % 3 &gt; 0)) : (X / 3 - (X % -3 &lt; 0))&quot;">
      <data key="d3">9.0</data>
      <data key="d4">"The assignment 'e = (x &gt; 0) ? (x / 3 + (x % 3 &gt; 0)) : (x / 3 - (x % -3 &lt; 0))' is the action taken within the 'else' block."</data>
      <data key="d5">chunk-2d49adf7c339e42e84130e12d95429c1</data>
      <data key="d6">1</data>
    </edge>
